id: rht_unidriver_driver
package: board_drivers
label: RHT UniDriver - Temperature/Humidity (Si70xx + SHT4x)
description: |-
  Unified driver for Si70xx (BRD4002A) and SHT4x (BRD4002B) sensors.
  Works transparently regardless of which sensor is connected.
  Use for demos or firmware where the RHT hardware is not known.

  Note: When the target board and RHT part are known, prefer a single sensor
  component to reduce flash: si70xx_driver for BRD4002A (Si70xx) and sht4x_driver
  for BRD4002B (SHT4x). This component pulls in both backends; add it when one
  binary must support either sensor.
category: Platform|Board Drivers
quality: production
metadata:
  sbom:
    license: Zlib
root_path: board_drivers/hardware/driver/rht_unidriver
provides:
- name: rht_unidriver_driver
requires:
- name: i2cspm
- name: sleeptimer
- name: status
- name: si70xx_driver
- name: sht4x_driver
include:
- path: inc
  file_list:
  - path: sl_rht_unidriver.h
source:
- path: src/sl_rht_unidriver.c
template_contribution:
- name: component_catalog
  value: rht_unidriver_driver
